  "screenwriter_raw": "{\n  \"pseudos\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"p1\",\n      \"text\": \"After more than two years of proceedings under competition law, the search engine provider found its remedy proposals rejected by Brussels. European regulators are finalizing a monetary sanction that adds to a long history of regulatory fines against the parent company Alphabet, deepening a long history of strained and broken bonds with the market.\",\n      \"fit\": 0.6,\n      \"center\": \"result-1\",\n      \"channel\": \"toned\",\n      \"source\": {\n        \"fragments\": [\"why-1\", \"how-0\", \"how-1\", \"how-2\", \"result-1\"]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"p2\",\n      \"text\": \"The one who broke the faith of fair competition now faces a heavy price for the rupture of fair connection. For prioritizing its own family of comparison platforms over the overlooked and unfairly shadowed competing businesses in its results, a large financial penalty is expected to reach the high hundreds of millions of euros.\",\n      \"fit\": 0.75,\n      \"center\": \"result-0\",\n      \"channel\": \"toned\",\n      \"source\": {\n        \"fragments\": [\"why-0\", \"result-0\"]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"p3\",\n      \"text\": \"A repeat betrayer of the market's trust stands accused by the enforcers of trust for self-preferencing in search results. The technology company's actions ranked rival comparison services, the jilted suitors in the marketplace, below its own units. A formal decision on an antitrust fine is expected before the Commission's August recess.\",\n      \"fit\": 0.7,\n      \"center\": \"who-2\",\n      \"channel\": \"toned\",\n      \"source\": {\n        \"fragments\": [\"why-0\", \"how-3\", \"result-0\"]\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}",
